				\begin{document}$$\varphi$$\end{document}φ = – .422]. To reduce the impacts of outliers and unequal variances across conditions, we rank-transformed people’s willingness to pay (higher scores indicating a willingness to pay more) and conducted a 3 (sample: Approved, Open, Blocked) × 2 (store location: fancy resort, run-down grocery store) between-subjects ANOVA on ranked WTP.

